      "summary": "Kensei Weapons: pick two weapons (one melee, one ranged; no heavy or special weapons), more at 6th, 11th and 17th; you're proficient and they count as monk weapons. Agile Parry: after an unarmed strike in the Attack action while holding a kensei weapon, +2 AC until your next turn. Kensei's Shot: bonus action, +1d4 damage on ranged kensei weapon hits this turn. Way of the Brush: calligrapher's or painter's supplies.",
      "source": {
        "pack": "table-2014",
        "book": "XGtE",
        "page": 34
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "kensei-weapons",
          "label": "Kensei weapons (at least one melee and one ranged)",
          "kind": "option",
          "count": 2,
          "countBy": "kenseiWeapons",
          "from": [
            "club",
            "dagger",
            "greatclub",
            "handaxe",
